{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53897","headline":"入云门五云溪上作（六言） · 顾非熊","name":"入云门五云溪上作（六言）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舟泊有时垂钓，舟行不废闲吟。\n沿山寺寺花树，枕水家家竹林。\n鸳鸯昼飞溪静，鸜鹆夜转村深。\n忽闻风动莲叶，起见波间月沉。\n（《会稽掇英总集》卷八）（按：《会稽棳英总集》卷六收非熊《宿云门寺》，《全唐诗》卷五八二作温庭筠诗，卷五一○作张祜诗，题均作《题造微禅师院》。\n《茅山志》卷二八收非熊《赠茅山高拾遗》，《全唐诗》卷五○六作章孝标诗。\n孰作尚难确定，姑附识於此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}